{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_almond_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_almond_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"远航","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_almond_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"ac0658710abf819390dcc22a8635983ff9b74f3d3c3f4799168837ab27f2e0a2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"从达维镇归来的罗拉，在提交行动报告后，对自己的未来做出了决定。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉？你对巴伦基地应该没有那么陌生吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，我有点出神......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你直直地盯着桌上的模型，我还以为它出了什么问题呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听前辈们说，这个模型可是巴伦基地改造完成、交付使用时，工程队专门制作的纪念品......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它真的没问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。它看上去......就和现在的基地一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么说我就放心了。那我们继续？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备好了哦，等我看下你的报告......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，收到追捕银行劫匪的命令后，你采取了什么行动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候我正带领工程小队再次确认地块连接结构的稳固性，收到消息后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我选择继续手头的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈述你如此行动的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接收到的命令是，除了参与地块对接工作的人员外，其他小队开始追捕银行劫匪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我判断地块对接工作仍需要人手，而我们工程小队本就需要加入其中，属于相关人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我选择听从指令，不改变原先的接驳工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但根据报告上的内容，在实施银行劫案的劫匪中，有一位是你在达维镇的同伴。你当时清楚这一消息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这一消息，你当时的判断是怎样的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"判断......我的判断？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我不会重复第二遍。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的判断......我没做什么判断......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是黑钢的雇员，奉命行事是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的职责。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（皱眉）......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“奉命行事，罗拉，你做出了正确的决定。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？罗拉，我学得还挺像那么回事的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有刚刚那句，“我不会重复第二遍”，简直一模一样是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......罗拉，怎么了？你的脸色好像不太好。不会是......我给你的压迫感太强了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的......我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托，我们继续吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚......那就是最后一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，我必须得告诉你，从达维镇回来以后，你就一直表现得有些心神不宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都知道，那是一场非常特殊的行动，而那时候你恰好就处在漩涡的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的难以想象你经历了什么，但即便如此，你也不能一直这么紧绷着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，现在的你需要的是休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且是好好休息。别再想行动报告的事了，你应该申请一个长假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对......我不能再这么消沉下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿莉莎，陪我再来一遍，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉......你根本就没有听我说话......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说，罗拉，你最好别去做这个行动报告了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经过去两周了，没人会再说起那件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不过是公司历程中的一个小插曲而已，你做得再认真，主管肯定也只是装模作样地听一听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐说得很对，你还不如找主管去批个长假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我得去做这次报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从一开始就到了达维镇，很多事情是我亲眼所见，亲身经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在行动中执行命令，行动后做好行动报告，这都是黑钢雇员的职责所在，更何况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿莉莎，你看到我在报告上写的东西了吧？那些事情难道不应该被整理汇报上去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要报告，达维镇发生的事情已经再清晰不过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在完成政府委托任务的过程中，有一位黑钢员工违规参与了犯罪活动，严重影响了公司的形象与声誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，我们都清楚，这不是一件值得反复提及的事情，尤其是在......两周之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们靠工资吃饭，只用奉命行事，保住自己的饭碗就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要让自己那么烦恼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我还是要找人问清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪里痛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"屁股......痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"屁股痛没事，长教训。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道错了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我知道了，妈妈，我不该在床底下折腾......\n可是......妈妈，我真的喜欢那些机械零件。我知道你不喜欢我碰这些东西，所以我只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看起来你不知道自己错在哪里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃完饭，跟我来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小罗拉，你这么急着约我出来，有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，我有件事情想问问你的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是达维镇的事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有这么明显吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平时最会逗大家开心的小开心果出了趟门忽然变得闷闷不乐，猜不出来才比较难吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于达维镇的事，我整理了一份报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告的话，雷蛇已经提交过一份了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，已经过去相当长一段时间了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我大概能猜到，那份报告里写了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以告诉你，如果你真的递交上去会发生什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的报告会被无视，你的问题不会得到回答，如果收到你报告的人心情不好，说不定你还会挨一个处分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经过去两周了，有时候我还是会想起镇上的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇上的情况我们都看到了，杰西卡为大家做了最多的事，还总觉得自己做得不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是一直都这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......芙兰卡，我在达维镇的表现，是不是很差？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真没看出来，小开心果的果仁里，原来那么富有正义感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是正义感的问题——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最后，你们至少能去找她，那个时候我在干什么呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在杰西卡被层层围堵的危机关头，我却待在本舰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明当时......明明当时......我真的很想和她一起留下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们穿着黑钢的制服，听从上头的命令，有些事做不到并不是你的过错。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们的雷蛇队长在这里，她一定会语重心长地这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，她大概会给你一个温暖的拥抱，让你感受到你在这艘舰船上并不是没有依靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，难道你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是告诉你，你现在转身去找雷蛇的话，或许能获得更温暖的建议和安慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我这里，你只会听到一些刺耳的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小开心果，你呀，究竟是在后悔自己没帮上杰西卡，还是在嫉妒杰西卡能做选择？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你写的这份报告，是为了所谓的真相，还是为了说服自己，我并不是一个胆小鬼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我生在一个普通的家庭，母亲是个普通医生，可我的人生并没有太多自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟着家人一起搬家，离开玻利瓦尔去哥伦比亚。好不容易考上大学，快毕业时又染上了矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的科技公司都不要我，我能去的只有黑钢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而来到这里以后，我学会的第一件事，就是听从指令，跟着队伍行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在嫉妒她能做选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布林雷这个姓氏带给杰西卡的负担远比带给她的资源要多得多，这一点我们都看在眼里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不羡慕她的财富，我知道，她肩上的东西比我多得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但正是因为这样，我才不明白，为什么杰西卡能够做出选择？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默凝固在她们之间。\n许久，棕发的沃尔珀仰起脑袋，对着低垂的夜幕轻叹了一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时，如果你和我们一起收到命令去追杰西卡，你会对她举起铳吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这是命令呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不愿意伤害她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样，你也做出了一次选择，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这怎么算——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们又不像杰西卡那样来自大户人家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人物做个决定会影响许多人，我们小人物呢，做的决定能影响自己就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不可以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退一步说，承认自己只是不想当胆小鬼......比所谓的追求真相可要坦率多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相不重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对真相来说，有些时候，被记住比什么都强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就这么一说，你也就这么一听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和雷蛇现在外派的那个叫罗德岛的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要执行的任务虽然挺困难的，不过福利还不错，而且，那边的人还挺有人情味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有的小开心果觉得黑钢的空气不适合她的生长——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换个土壤也是个选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，芙兰卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，他们说这种烦恼找你就对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这是什么说法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说，“芙兰卡虽然嘴上不饶人，但是你有麻烦她一定会好好帮你解决的”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪个混账东西坏我名声？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n妈妈，我们怎么......回房间了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你对那些机械设备感兴趣吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你为什么不问问我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"问......问你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我不喜欢你捣鼓那些零件，不希望你最后和你奶奶一样，整天闷在工作车间里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是你应该问问我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我怕你会拒绝我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我很有可能拒绝你。但同样，也会出现另一种可能性，另一个选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不尝试，就永远不会有其他的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到那张桌子了吗？以后那就是你的工作台了，把你的东西都从床底下搬出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在就去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，找我有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，我的上一个任务是达维镇的......您应该知道那件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于那个任务，我按照惯例，写了一份行动报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有这个惯例吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行动报告......哦，我想起来了，确实有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是件大任务，过程中也有不少波折。能整理成报告，辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，你的报告一定能帮助我们补上许多关于事件的细节。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在罗拉的注视下，桌对面的人快速地翻阅了一下她的报告。\n然后叹了口气。\n不出她所料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的报告并不应该是这样的，罗拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是技术岗，报告里不应该有和工程任务无关的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。但是，我在执行任务的过程中，并不只有工程相关的见闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能欺骗自己的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，反正也不会有人看到这份报告，就这样吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他翻到了报告的最后一页，在上面流畅地签下了自己的姓名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的职业生涯还很长，罗拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要学会判断自己看到了什么，又没看到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，主管，我只是个工程人员，对这方面实在不算很了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我有一个请求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程主管","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说说看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，申请参与新一轮的交流项目，调派去罗德岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g10_blacksteelarmory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，那我们继续啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等等等，我还没有准备好，等我再整理一下情绪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，好了，开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你腰间玩偶的来历是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我腰间玩偶的......什么玩意？这真的是面试问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错啊，这本芙兰卡给的《面试题目大合集》中写着的，“偶尔会对面试者的穿着装饰提出问题”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......我的玩偶，是我妈妈给我做的，我一直带在身边。这样够不够？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没达到平均时长，但是应该够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你前面已经过了那么多堪称恐怖的测试......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡不是说了吗，只要前面的测试都过了，面试不过就是聊聊天。我看你也不用准备什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，要确保万无一失。快，下一题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题看上去还挺靠谱的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小罗拉！我来找你玩啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，在准备罗德岛的面试吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你已经想得很清楚啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然。嘘，一会儿再聊，等我先回答完这个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，关于你的未来，你有什么想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的未来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的......未来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n妈妈，我们一定要离开家吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里太危险了，宝贝，我们不能再待下去了。我不能让你在战火中长大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，妈妈也不想这样，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们的命运，大部分时候都不由我们自己决定，我......没有选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"选择......我不懂，选择是什么......\n妈妈，不要哭......你还有我。我能做你的选择吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的......罗拉，宝贝，是的。你是我的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。今后，我们会到新的地方，你会看见一些新鲜事，遇见一些新的人，有一大片新的命运等待着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，你也会再次面对这样看起来别无他路的困境，不知道未来将去往何方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个时候，你只要记得，坚持走下去，你就会发现，选择其实就在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而这一次，你会有足够的勇气，去做出决定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
